            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1466] Load jar doesn&apos;t work in %dep interpreter in 0.6.1 version</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1466</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Loading of jars doesn&apos;t work in %dep interpreter in version 0.6.1&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;  %dep&lt;br/&gt;
  z.load(&quot;/path/to.jar&quot;)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Logs don&apos;t contain any errors or any clue about the cause of this issue.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here is the mailing thread &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-zeppelin-users-incubating-mailing-list.75479.x6.nabble.com/Why-the-deprecation-of-dep-td3976.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-zeppelin-users-incubating-mailing-list.75479.x6.nabble.com/Why-the-deprecation-of-dep-td3976.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
