                            <comment id="15522124" author="mina lee" created="Mon, 26 Sep 2016 05:37:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Just verified that %dep doesn&apos;t work on 0.6.1 but it works on branch-0.6 and master. Can anyone else also verify this so I can mark this issue to resolved?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15523027" author="vitaliy_zinchenko" created="Mon, 26 Sep 2016 13:15:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue reproduces. Here are steps:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Checkout to branch-0.6&lt;br/&gt;
2) execute: ./dev/change_scala_version.sh 2.11&lt;br/&gt;
3) execute: mvn clean package -Dmaven.test.skip=true -Phadoop-2.6 -Pspark-2.0 -Pbuild-distr -Pscala-2.11&lt;br/&gt;
4) start Zeppelin: ./bin/zeppelin.sh&lt;br/&gt;
5) Execute in the notebook:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;%dep
z.load(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/home/zinjvi/projects/product.jar&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;the result is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;DepInterpreter(%dep) deprecated. Load dependency through GUI interpreter menu instead.
res0: org.apache.zeppelin.dep.Dependency = org.apache.zeppelin.dep.Dependency@10d861fa
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;%spark
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; model.v1._
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;the result is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;console&amp;gt;:25: error: not found: value model
       &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; model.v1._
              ^
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;What do I wrong?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15523265" author="mina lee" created="Mon, 26 Sep 2016 14:44:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Vitaliy_Zinchenko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Vitaliy_Zinchenko&quot;&gt;Vitaliy_Zinchenko&lt;/a&gt; Please forget my previous comment which I removed by mistake &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/sad.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;, I tested Spark 2.0 &amp;amp; Scala 2.11 and Spark 2.0 &amp;amp; Scala 2.10 again and it seems to work for me.&lt;br/&gt;
Could you check in the logs/zeppelin-interpreter-spark*.log if you see that jar has been added like below?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt; INFO [2016-09-26 23:36:53,351] ({pool-2-thread-2} Logging.scala[logInfo]:54) - Added JAR /Users/mina/Downloads/my.jar at spark:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//222.106.235.154:57451/jars/my.jar with timestamp 1474900613351
&lt;/span&gt; INFO [2016-09-26 23:36:53,357] ({pool-2-thread-2} SparkInterpreter.java[open]:885) - sc.addJar(/Users/mina/Downloads/my.jar)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15523782" author="vitaliy_zinchenko" created="Mon, 26 Sep 2016 18:09:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Mina+Lee&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Mina Lee&quot;&gt;Mina Lee&lt;/a&gt;, yes, I see these two lines in the log file. But I still have an error when I try to use some package or class from loaded jar. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt; INFO [2016-09-26 20:52:05,223] ({pool-2-thread-3} Logging.scala[logInfo]:54) - Added JAR /home/zinjvi/projects/product.jar at spark:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//192.168.0.103:44111/jars/product.jar with timestamp 1474912325221
&lt;/span&gt; INFO [2016-09-26 20:52:05,238] ({pool-2-thread-3} SparkInterpreter.java[open]:885) - sc.addJar(/home/zinjvi/projects/product.jar)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Could be the cause of my issue in the way I build zeppeling? Could you please point me how do you build zeppelin?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15525093" author="mina lee" created="Tue, 27 Sep 2016 05:10:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is the command that I use for build&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;$ git checkout branch-0.6
$ git pull
$ ./dev/change_scala_version.sh 2.11
$ mvn clean &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; -DskipTests -Pscala-2.11 -Pspark-2.0 -pl &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;!zeppelin-distribution,!file,!alluxio,!livy,!hbase,!bigquery,!python,!jdbc,!ignite,!lens,!postgresql,!cassandra,!kylin,!elasticsearch,!flink&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
$ ./bin/zeppelin-daemon.sh
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Your build command looks fine. I tried same build as yours, still cannot reproduce it &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/sad.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could you set &lt;tt&gt;SPARK_HOME&lt;/tt&gt; in conf/zeppelin-env.sh and try it again?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15525957" author="vitaliy_zinchenko" created="Tue, 27 Sep 2016 12:25:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Mina+Lee&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Mina Lee&quot;&gt;Mina Lee&lt;/a&gt;, after daclaration &lt;tt&gt;SPARK_HOME&lt;/tt&gt; in conf/zeppelin-env.sh to the spark &lt;tt&gt;spark-2.0.0-bin-hadoop2.7&lt;/tt&gt; %dep works. So, looks like this is the cause of my issue.&lt;br/&gt;
Is this mentioned in the documentation that %dep doesn&apos;t work without this configuration? &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
